{"title": "Murderous Strikes (Condition)", "pageid": 24617, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Murderous_Strikes_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status properties", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Murderous Strikes Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Murderous Strikes</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>After performing four attacks, Sarevok will have embodied Bhaal enough to use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deathbringer Assault\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault\">Deathbringer Assault</a>.</li>\n<li>After performing five attacks, Orin will have embodied Bhaal enough to use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault_(Orin)\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault (Orin)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deathbringer Assault (Orin)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault_(Orin)\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault (Orin)\">Deathbringer Assault (Orin)</a> </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOW_ORIN_DEATHBRINGER_COUNTER</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CLOW_ORIN_DEATHBRINGER_COUNTER%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CLOW_ORIN_DEATHBRINGER_COUNTER%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/ForceOverhead\" title=\"Status properties/ForceOverhead\">ForceOverhead</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>LOW_ORIN_DEATHBRINGER_COUNTER</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Deathbringer's_Legacy\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer%27s_Legacy_(Condition)\" title=\"Deathbringer's Legacy (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deathbringer's Legacy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer%27s_Legacy_(Condition)\" title=\"Deathbringer's Legacy (Condition)\">Deathbringer's Legacy</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Sarevok is able to use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deathbringer Assault\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault\">Deathbringer Assault</a> until the end of his next turn.</li>\n<li>Orin can use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault_(Orin)\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault (Orin)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deathbringer Assault (Orin)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault_(Orin)\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault (Orin)\">Deathbringer Assault (Orin)</a> until the end of her next turn.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Murderous_Strikes\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Murderous_Strikes_(Condition)\" title=\"Murderous Strikes (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Murderous Strikes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Murderous Strikes</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>After performing four attacks, Sarevok will have embodied Bhaal enough to use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deathbringer Assault\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault\">Deathbringer Assault</a>.</li>\n<li>After performing five attacks, Orin will have embodied Bhaal enough to use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault_(Orin)\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault (Orin)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deathbringer Assault (Orin)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault_(Orin)\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault (Orin)\">Deathbringer Assault (Orin)</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\